Package: anicloud
Version: @PROJECT_VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AniCloud <support@anicloud.ink>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libstdc++6, libgl1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libsecret-1-0
Description: AniCloud native desktop streaming client
 A native Qt Quick anime streaming application with offline playback support.
